/*
 * Implements semantic validation for map comprehensions iterating over a
 * generator.
 *
 * The generator is resumed until exhaustion, and the pair produced at each
 * yielded value is inserted in the constructed map.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::mapfor::yield_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/mapfor/yield_.yr
 * @Author(s):
